{"unit_id":"tag:03YD:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n在《代数空间》的第 <REF_0001> 节中，我们介绍了用开子空间（open subspaces）给出代数空间（algebraic space）的 Zariski 覆盖（Zariski covering）的概念。这里给出将开子空间（open subspaces）替换为开浸入（open immersions）后的相应概念。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"open subspaces","target_term":"开子空间"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"Zariski covering","target_term":"Zariski 覆盖"},{"source_term":"open subspaces","target_term":"开子空间"},{"source_term":"open immersions","target_term":"开浸入"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"open subspaces","target_term":"开子空间","context":"覆盖的成员；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间","context":"被覆盖的对象；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"Zariski covering","target_term":"Zariski 覆盖","context":"本节定义的覆盖；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"open immersions","target_term":"开浸入","context":"替换开子空间后的态射；暂译待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:041G:statement","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 是概形（scheme），<MATH_0002> 是 <MATH_0003> 上的代数空间（algebraic space）。<MATH_0004> 的<TEXTITOPEN_0001>Zariski 覆盖（Zariski covering）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>是 <MATH_0006> 上的代数空间（algebraic spaces）的态射族（family of morphisms）<MATH_0005>，其中每个 <MATH_0007> 都是开浸入（open immersion），且 <MATH_0008>，即这些态射（morphisms）联合为满射（surjective）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"Zariski covering","target_term":"Zariski 覆盖"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"family of morphisms","target_term":"态射族"},{"source_term":"open immersion","target_term":"开浸入"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"基底；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间","context":"被覆盖对象；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"Zariski covering","target_term":"Zariski 覆盖","context":"所定义的覆盖；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间","context":"族中对象；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"family of morphisms","target_term":"态射族","context":"覆盖族；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"open immersion","target_term":"开浸入","context":"覆盖成员的性质；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"覆盖成员；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射","context":"联合满射条件；暂译待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:03YD:prose-0002","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n虽然 Zariski 覆盖（coverings）偶尔有用，但代数空间（algebraic spaces）的范畴（category）上相应的拓扑（topology）实在过于粗糙，并没有多少用处。不过，它确实定义了一个位点（site）。\n\n","allowed_english":["Zariski"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖","context":"Zariski 覆盖；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间","context":"范畴中的对象；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴","context":"赋予拓扑的范畴；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑","context":"对应的拓扑；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点","context":"拓扑定义的位点；暂译待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:041H:statement","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 是概形（scheme）。设 <MATH_0002> 是 <MATH_0003> 上的代数空间（algebraic space）。\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 若 <MATH_0004> 是同构（isomorphism），则 <MATH_0005> 是 <MATH_0006> 的 Zariski 覆盖（Zariski covering）。\n<STRUCT_0003> 若 <MATH_0007> 是 Zariski 覆盖（Zariski covering），且对每个 <MATH_0008> 都有 Zariski 覆盖（Zariski covering）<MATH_0009>，则 <MATH_0010> 是 Zariski 覆盖（Zariski covering）。\n<STRUCT_0004> 若 <MATH_0011> 是 Zariski 覆盖（Zariski covering），且 <MATH_0012> 是代数空间（algebraic spaces）的态射（morphism），则 <MATH_0013> 是 Zariski 覆盖（Zariski covering）。\n<STRUCT_0005>\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"Zariski covering","target_term":"Zariski 覆盖"},{"source_term":"Zariski covering","target_term":"Zariski 覆盖"},{"source_term":"Zariski covering","target_term":"Zariski 覆盖"},{"source_term":"Zariski covering","target_term":"Zariski 覆盖"},{"source_term":"Zariski covering","target_term":"Zariski 覆盖"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"Zariski covering","target_term":"Zariski 覆盖"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"基底；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间","context":"对象；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构","context":"首条公理；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"Zariski covering","target_term":"Zariski 覆盖","context":"三条覆盖公理；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间","context":"态射的对象；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"第三条公理；暂译待决。"}],"notes":[]}
