{"unit_id":"tag:03YC:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n本节讨论代数空间（algebraic spaces）的平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）覆盖（covering）的概念，并定义代数空间（algebraic space）的大平展（<ACCENT_0002>tale）位点（site）。请与《拓扑（Topologies）》第 <REF_0001> 节比较。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0002>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"Topologies","target_term":"拓扑"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间","context":"覆盖对象；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展","context":"覆盖类型；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖","context":"本节概念；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间","context":"大位点所属对象；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0002>tale","target_term":"平展","context":"大位点类型；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点","context":"本节定义；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"Topologies","target_term":"拓扑","context":"引用章节名；暂译待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:041E:statement","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 是概形（scheme），<MATH_0002> 是 <MATH_0003> 上的代数空间（algebraic space）。<MATH_0004> 的<TEXTITOPEN_0001>平展覆盖（<ACCENT_0001>tale covering）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>是态射族（family of morphisms）<MATH_0005>，其成员是 <MATH_0006> 上的代数空间（algebraic spaces），每个 <MATH_0007> 都是平展（<ACCENT_0002>tale）的，且 <MATH_0008>，即这些态射（morphisms）联合为满射（surjective）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale covering","target_term":"平展覆盖"},{"source_term":"family of morphisms","target_term":"态射族"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0002>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"基底；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间","context":"被覆盖对象；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale covering","target_term":"平展覆盖","context":"所定义的族；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"family of morphisms","target_term":"态射族","context":"覆盖族；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间","context":"族中对象；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0002>tale","target_term":"平展","context":"覆盖成员的性质；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"覆盖成员；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射","context":"联合满射；暂译待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:03YC:prose-0002","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n这与《拓扑（Topologies）》定义 <REF_0001> 完全相同。特别地，若 <MATH_0001> 和所有 <MATH_0002> 都是概形（schemes），就得到概形（schemes）的通常平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）覆盖（covering）概念。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"Topologies","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"Topologies","target_term":"拓扑","context":"引用章节名；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"恢复通常定义；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展","context":"覆盖类型；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖","context":"通常覆盖；暂译待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0DF1:statement","translation":"任何 Zariski 覆盖（Zariski covering）都是平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）覆盖（covering）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"Zariski covering","target_term":"Zariski 覆盖"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"Zariski covering","target_term":"Zariski 覆盖","context":"较特殊的覆盖；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展","context":"覆盖类型；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖","context":"结论中的覆盖；暂译待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0DF1:proof","translation":"这由定义及开浸入（open immersion）是平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）态射（morphism）的事实立即得出（此事实由《态射（Morphisms）》引理 <REF_0001> 经由《代数空间》引理 <REF_0002> 得到，因为浸入（immersions）是可表（representable）的）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"open immersion","target_term":"开浸入"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"immersions","target_term":"浸入"},{"source_term":"representable","target_term":"可表"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"open immersion","target_term":"开浸入","context":"所用事实；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展","context":"态射性质；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"所用事实；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"引用章节名；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"immersions","target_term":"浸入","context":"可表性；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"representable","target_term":"可表","context":"转用引理的条件；暂译待决。"}],"notes":[]}
